    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my bosch dishwasher is showing an e15 error code and won't start. what am i supposed to do to fix this?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The E15 error code typically indicates an issue with the dishwasher's door switch or a faulty sole plate switch. To resolve this, first check if the door is properly closed and if the alignment wires are not loose. Next, inspect the sole plate switch for damage or debris, and adjust or clean it as needed. If the issue persists, it's recommended to consult the user manual or contact a professional repair service to diagnose and fix the problem.",
