      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To access the leak sensors in the bottom of your Bosch dishwasher, you'll need to remove the lower rack and the spray arm. Start by disconnecting the water supply and unplugging the dishwasher. Remove the lower rack, and then remove the clips or screws holding it in place. Gently pull the lower rack out, being careful not to push anything out of the way. From there, you should be able to access the leak sensors and clean or replace them if necessary.",
